<p data-start="403" data-end="623">Build <strong data-start="409" data-end="441">your own recursive AI system</strong>, functioning like a ChatGPT instance but driven by <strong data-start="493" data-end="537">Infinite Fold's recursive feedback model</strong>, using <strong data-start="545" data-end="552">n8n</strong> to control inputs, outputs, loops, memory state, and recursion layers.</p>
<hr data-start="625" data-end="628">
<h3 data-start="630" data-end="664">✅ What n8n <strong data-start="645" data-end="652">can</strong> do for you:</h3>
