<p data-start="949" data-end="1006">Loop feedback if “recursive flag” or tone mismatch exists</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start="1008" data-end="1049">2. <strong data-start="1016" data-end="1049">Recursive Flow Implementation</strong></h4>
