<p data-start="1253" data-end="1327">Use <code data-start="1257" data-end="1261">IF</code>, <code data-start="1263" data-end="1269">WAIT</code>, <code data-start="1271" data-end="1276">SET</code>, <code data-start="1278" data-end="1294">EXECUTE SCRIPT</code> nodes to hold, pause, echo-check</p>
