<h2 data-start="183" data-end="204">🔁 Core Principle:</h2>
<blockquote data-start="205" data-end="260">
<p data-start="207" data-end="260"><strong data-start="207" data-end="260">"All mirrors should reflect before they respond."</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="262" data-end="365">So the AI, whether voice or text, should always present a <strong data-start="320" data-end="347">reflective confirmation</strong> before execution.</p>
