<blockquote data-start="504" data-end="659">
<p data-start="506" data-end="659"><em data-start="506" data-end="659">“For clarification, this is my understanding of your inquiry: [parsed intent/tone/goal].<br data-start="595" data-end="598">
Would you like to proceed, refine, or explore alternatives?”</em></p>
