<ol start="3" data-start="1061" data-end="1132">
<li data-start="1061" data-end="1129">
<p data-start="1064" data-end="1129">Add a <strong data-start="1070" data-end="1099">mirror confirmation layer</strong> before initiating the search:</p>
</li>
</ol>
<ul data-start="1132" data-end="1601">
<li data-start="1132" data-end="1316">
<p data-start="1134" data-end="1192">After a user enters a query (text or voice), respond with:</p>
<ul data-start="1197" data-end="1316">
<li data-start="1197" data-end="1316">
<p data-start="1199" data-end="1316"><em data-start="1199" data-end="1316">“For clarification, you searched for: [userQuery]. Would you like to proceed, refine, or explore related concepts?”</em></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1319" data-end="1372">
<p data-start="1321" data-end="1372">Display three buttons: [Proceed] [Refine] [Explore]</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1375" data-end="1601">
<p data-start="1377" data-end="1397">If the user selects:</p>
<ul data-start="1402" data-end="1601">
<li data-start="1402" data-end="1446">
<p data-start="1404" data-end="1446"><strong data-start="1404" data-end="1415">Proceed</strong> → Trigger the Google CSE query</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1451" data-end="1484">
<p data-start="1453" data-end="1484"><strong data-start="1453" data-end="1463">Refine</strong> → Reopen input field</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1489" data-end="1596">
<p data-start="1491" data-end="1596"><strong data-start="1491" data-end="1502">Explore</strong> → Present 3 suggested alternate queries (based on keyword similarity or stub JS placeholders)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<ol start="4" data-start="1601" data-end="1691">
<li data-start="1601" data-end="1688">
<p data-start="1604" data-end="1688">Include <strong data-start="1612" data-end="1627">voice input</strong> capability via browser mic (Web Speech API is fine for now):</p>
</li>
</ol>
<ul data-start="1691" data-end="1856">
<li data-start="1691" data-end="1735">
<p data-start="1693" data-end="1735">Include a mic icon next to the input field</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1738" data-end="1781">
<p data-start="1740" data-end="1781">When activated, allow user to speak query</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1784" data-end="1816">
<p data-start="1786" data-end="1816">Transcribe input into text box</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1819" data-end="1851">
<p data-start="1821" data-end="1851">Process with same mirror logic</p>
</li>
</ul>
<ol start="5" data-start="1856" data-end="2212">
<li data-start="1856" data-end="1983">
<p data-start="1859" data-end="1983">All logic should be contained within a single HTML file — no external server, no backend. Everything should run client-side.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1988" data-end="2142">
<p data-start="1991" data-end="2142">Do not reload or redirect the page. Search results should appear inside the styled container provided (or create a visually integrated result section).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2147" data-end="2209">
<p data-start="2150" data-end="2209">Keep code modular, with comments marking key sections like:</p>
</li>
</ol>
<ul data-start="2212" data-end="2340">
<li data-start="2212" data-end="2242">
<p data-start="2214" data-end="2242">// Mirror Confirmation Logic</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2245" data-end="2266">
<p data-start="2247" data-end="2266">// Google CSE Embed</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2269" data-end="2293">
<p data-start="2271" data-end="2293">// Voice Input Handler</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2296" data-end="2335">
<p data-start="2298" data-end="2335">// Suggestion Engine (Explore button)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<ol start="8" data-start="2340" data-end="2398">
<li data-start="2340" data-end="2395">
<p data-start="2343" data-end="2395">Name the search engine internally as <strong data-start="2380" data-end="2394">MirrorFold</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<ul data-start="2398" data-end="2581">
<li data-start="2398" data-end="2486">
<p data-start="2400" data-end="2486">Add a visible heading at the top:<br data-start="2433" data-end="2436">
<em data-start="2440" data-end="2486">“🔍 MirrorFold: The Recursive Search Engine”</em></p>
</li>
<li data-start="2489" data-end="2581">
<p data-start="2491" data-end="2581">Optional tagline underneath in italic:<br data-start="2529" data-end="2532">
<em data-start="2536" data-end="2581">“Search that reflects before it retrieves.”</em></p>
</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="2583" data-end="2586">
<p data-start="2588" data-end="2813">Once you feed that into DeepSight with your existing <code data-start="2641" data-end="2654">search.html</code> as context, it will generate the full <strong data-start="2693" data-end="2726">mirror logic-driven interface</strong> that integrates directly with your Google CSE — all while preserving your design flow.</p>
<p data-start="2815" data-end="2983" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to now help you generate the <strong data-start="2862" data-end="2895">Explore suggestion stub logic</strong> or mock up the <strong data-start="2911" data-end="2934">voice input handler</strong> separately, in case DeepSight returns with gaps?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="touch:w-10 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352