<h3 data-start="2008" data-end="2052">3. <strong data-start="2015" data-end="2052">Update App.css (Optional Cleanup)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="2054" data-end="2272">Ensure your Tailwind or <code data-start="2078" data-end="2087">App.css</code> includes scrollbar control and spacing that doesn't block the CSE results. You’ve already done most of this, so just double-check that <code data-start="2223" data-end="2242">min-height: 100vh</code> and <code data-start="2247" data-end="2265">overflow-y: auto</code> exist.</p>
<hr data-start="2274" data-end="2277">
